hoot using AI, CGI, and VFX.\n\nThe film follows a racing fan watching a high-intensity motorsport race as the competition unfolds lap by lap. As strategies shift, positions change, and the tension builds, he reaches for an energy drink, connecting the product with the speed, focus, and excitement of the moment.\n\nEvery element in the film has been digitally created through our proprietary AI-powered production pipeline. The product, character, racing sequences, vehicles, stadium environments, lighting, camera movements, and visual effects are crafted with precision and refined through CGI, VFX, and post-production workflows to ensure realism, consistency, and production-ready quality.\n\nThe commercial showcases detailed race sequences, pit stops, tire changes, overtakes, leaderboard shifts, crowd energy, and victory celebrations, creating an immersive sporting atmosphere. Throughout the film, the energy drink is integrated through premium product shots, realistic actor interaction, and cinematic close-ups designed to reinforce brand recall.\n\n🎬 AI + CGI + VFX Production\n⚡ Premium Product Integration\n🏁 High-Energy Sports Storytelling\n🎵 Original Music\n\nEvery product model, environment, animation, and character is produced using our unique proprietary  AI, CGI, & VFX production pipeline powered by our high-end GPU computers, enabling brands to create high-end appliance ad films without studios, cameras, or live production. Even before we start production, our AI-powered CGI experts use shared and available product images to create perfect digital double / precise 3D model of client’s product for product accuracy in the final video\n\n🔗 Learn more: https://www.v4b.ai\n📩 Business inquiries: grow@v4b.ai\n\nV4b.ai is an Agency creating Content & Videos Without Any Physical Shoot, using high-end GPU Computers powering CGI, VFX, and AI, operated by specialists. Our production-grade pipelines outperform prompt-based GenAI platforms, delivering cinematic Ad Films, eCommerce Videos, and more from Concept to Final Cut. \n\neCommerce/D2C Listing Videos - Most D2C buyers abandon eCom pages without completing a purchase as they aren’t convinced by images alone. Even before we start production, our AI-powered CGI experts use shared and available product images to create perfect digital double / precise 3D model of client’s product for product accuracy in the final video, then producing Marketplace-Optimized Videos & Images, that increase ‘Add-to-Cart’ by building customer trust, ready to get listed on Amazon, Shopify & more.\n\nFrom Concept to Final Cut, we create Ad Films - Our custom production tech-stack helps our creative team with realistic environments, lifelike AI humans, multi-language voiceovers and dialogues. No sets. No actors. Just Platform-Optimized Films ready for Youtube, Meta, TV, OTT & more.\n\n#EnergyDrink #EnergyDrinkCommercial #AdFilm #CommercialFilm #SportsCommercial #RacingCommercial #Motorsport #RaceDay #BrandFilm #CinematicAd #AICommercial #AIVideo #CGI #VFX #AIAdvertising #CGIAdvertising #NoShootProduction #WithoutShoot #ProductVisualization #OriginalMusic #DigitalAdvertising #CreativeAdvertising #VisualStorytelling #PremiumCommercial #BrandCampaign #VideoProduction #FutureOfAdvertising #AIContent #V4BAI #VideosWithoutShoot", "channel_id": "UCjK5oJeQtU8o7gE89FLAMZw", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjK5oJeQtU8o7gE89FLAMZw", "duration": 16, "view_count": 55, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K-g0U0LdAzc", "categories": ["Film & Animation"], "tags": [], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {"en-orig": [{"ext": "json3", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/api/timedtext?v=K-g0U0LdAzc&ei=6ydWavS5Lp_N6dsP37ShoAU&caps=asr&opi=112496729&xoaf=5&xowf=1&xospf=1&hl=en&ip=0.0.0.0&ipbits=0&expire=1784056